    taskDescription: "Implement `typical_sampling_filter(logits, mass, filter_value=-float('inf'))`. Compute softmax probabilities $P$. Compute sequence entropy $H = -\sum P_i \log_2 P_i$. For each token, compute deviation $\Delta_i = |-\log_2 P_i - H|$. Sort tokens ascending by $\Delta_i$ (breaking ties by lower index). Accumulate tokens until cumulative probability is $\ge mass$. Mask unselected tokens with `filter_value`. If $mass \le 0.0$ or $mass > 1.0$, raise `ValueError`.",
