      strong: "When a matching child is found, kv_slots.extend(child['kv_slot_indices']) and update curr_node_id = child_id.",
      concept: "Radix Attention (used in SGLang) preserves KV cache states across requests, avoiding recomputation of identical system prompts or history.",
