    starterCode: "def profile_inference_performance(prefill_latency_ms: float, decode_latencies_ms: list[float], input_tokens: int, generated_tokens: int, gpu_memory_bandwidth_gb_s: float, model_params_b: float) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Analyze LLM serving latency metrics and classify hardware roofline bottlenecks.\n    \n    Args:\n        prefill_latency_ms: Latency to process prompt and produce first token (TTFT).\n        decode_latencies_ms: List of latencies for each subsequent generated token.\n        input_tokens: Prompt token count.\n        generated_tokens: Total tokens generated.\n        gpu_memory_bandwidth_gb_s: Peak GPU HBM bandwidth in GB/s.\n        model_params_b: Model size in billions of parameters.\n    Returns:\n        dict with 'ttft_ms', 'tpot_ms', 'total_latency_ms', 'throughput_tokens_per_sec', 'theoretical_min_tpot_ms', and 'primary_bottleneck'.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Your implementation here\n    pass\n",
    mission: "Profile serving latency distributions, compute TTFT/TPOT metrics, and diagnose roofline bottlenecks.",
    taskDescription: "Implement `profile_inference_performance(prefill_latency_ms, decode_latencies_ms, input_tokens, generated_tokens, gpu_memory_bandwidth_gb_s, model_params_b)`. Calculate TTFT (`prefill_latency_ms`), TPOT (mean of `decode_latencies_ms`), `total_latency_ms` (`prefill + sum(decodes)`), and throughput (total tokens / total time in seconds). Compute `theoretical_min_tpot_ms` based on memory bandwidth: $(2 \times \text{model\_params\_b} / \text{gpu\_memory\_bandwidth\_gb\_s}) \times 1000$. Classify `primary_bottleneck`: if `tpot_ms <= 2.5 * theoretical_min_tpot_ms`, label `'memory_bandwidth_bound'`; otherwise label `'compute_or_overhead_bound'`. Return dict with all computed metrics rounded to 2 decimal places. Raise `ValueError` on non-positive metrics or empty decode latencies.",
